# The launcher's Settings: every category and Back, Controls' text entered
# with Right, read line by line around and left with Escape, a setting
# stepped both ways and with Enter, a slider moved, the rows wrapping around
# past the hidden Diagnostics row, Left and Escape back to the categories,
# the lines between Online's rows,
# typing in a text field with a refused character, Tab and Shift+Tab, and
# back to Home both ways. Waits on each announcement, so a missing or changed
# line fails the run. Run in launcher mode, with accessibility on but muted,
# which the line reading needs (as run_level.py runs it):
#   python tools/a11y/drive.py --launcher --muted tools/a11y/launcher_settings.drive
# The run's settings folder starts from the defaults, so Player name holds
# PLAYER and the connect code is the run's own. Display mode is never
# pressed or stepped: fullscreen would take the screen (drive.py refuses it).

wait '"Melee launcher\. Ready to play'
key Down Down Down
wait '"Settings, button\. '
key Return
wait '"Settings\. Graphics\. Up and down to choose, right to enter\. How the game looks\."$'

# Every category, Controls' text on the way, then Back and round to
# Graphics.
key Down
wait '"Audio\. Volume and reverb\."$'
key Down
wait '"Gameplay\. Unlocks, stage hazards and controller fixes\."$'
key Down
wait '"Controls\. The keyboard layout and controller setup\."$'
key Right
wait '"Keyboard"$'
key Down
wait '"WASD, arrows Move"$'
key Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
wait '"IJKL C-stick"$'
key Down
wait '"Controller"$'
key Down
wait '"Remap a gamepad from the in-game menu: press BACK on the pad, or F1, then open Controls\. Controllers are only detected once the game is running\."$'
key Up
wait '"Controller"$'
key Down
wait '"Remap a gamepad '
key Down
wait '"Keyboard"$'
key Escape
wait '"Controls\. The keyboard layout and controller setup\."$'
key Down
wait '"Online\. Your player name, connect codes and input delay\."$'
key Down
wait '"Launcher\. The size of these menus, updates and the community\."$'
key Down
wait '"Back, button\. Back to the main menu\."$'
key Down
wait '"Graphics\. How the game looks\."$'

# Into Graphics' rows. Vertical sync off and on with Right and Left, then
# with Enter: the new value alone.
key Right
wait '"Display mode, Windowed, Left and right to change\. Windowed or fullscreen\."$'
key Down
wait '"Vertical sync, On, Left and right to change\. Synchronise presentation with your display\."$'
key Right
wait '"Off"$'
key Left
wait '"On"$'
key Return
wait '"Off"$'
key Return
wait '"On"$'

# Internal resolution, a slider: one step up and back.
key Down
wait '"Internal resolution, slider, Auto\. Left and right to adjust\. How sharp the game renders\. Auto follows the window size\."$'
key Right
wait '"1x"$'
key Left
wait '"Auto"$'
key Escape
wait '"Graphics\. How the game looks\."$'

# Launcher's rows: Up from the first wraps to the last shown, past
# Diagnostics, which only Android shows; Left on a button goes back.
key Up Up
wait '"Launcher\. '
key Right
wait '"Interface size, slider, 100%\. Left and right to adjust\. The size of these menus\."$'
key Up
wait '"Discord community: Join Discord, button\. Join the community Discord server in your browser\."$'
key Left
wait '"Launcher\. '

# Online: Player name, typed into with the cursor at the field's start. #
# is refused, letters go in as capitals, and a full field says so;
# Backspace puts PLAYER back.
key Up
wait '"Online\. '
key Right
wait '"Player name, edit, PLAYER\. 1-8 letters or digits\. Changes apply to the next search\."$'
type "#ab1"
wait '"# not allowed"$'
wait '"APLAYER"$'
wait '"ABPLAYER"$'
wait '"Full, 8 characters at most"$'
key Backspace
wait '"APLAYER"$'
key Backspace
wait '"PLAYER"$'

# The lines between Online's rows, read in their turn, and round to the
# first row.
key Down
wait '"Your connect code, PLAYER#\w+"$'
key Down
wait "\"Friend's connect code, edit, blank\. Leave blank to host your code\. Open Online, then Direct Connect, in the game\.\"$"
key Down
wait '"Input delay, Auto, Left and right to change\. Automatic adapts to your connection\. Changes apply next match\."$'
key Down
wait '"Internet discovery can take a few minutes\. Some home networks cannot connect without a relay\."$'
key Down
wait '"Player name, edit, PLAYER\. '

# Tab and Shift+Tab follow the same order.
key Shift+Tab
wait '"Internet discovery can take '
key Tab
wait '"Player name, edit, PLAYER\. '

# Off the field (which keeps Escape), then Escape twice: the category, then
# Home.
key Up Up
wait '"Input delay, Auto, '
key Escape
wait '"Online\. '
key Escape
wait '"Settings, button\. '

# Settings again opens on Online; Back returns Home.
key Return
wait '"Settings\. Online\. Up and down to choose, right to enter\. '
key Down Down
wait '"Back, button\. '
key Return
wait '"Settings, button\. '
